## 5. Validation / 400 handling (escalation)

OfficeFloor maps thrown exceptions to handlers by convention: a YAML file per exception type under `src/main/resources/officefloor/escalation/`.

**`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/resources/officefloor/escalation/org.springframework.web.bind.MethodArgumentNotValidException.yml`**
